# Monorepo

- Apps: `api` (Nest+Postgres+Prisma), `pms` (React/Vite/Tailwind/shadcn), `web` (Phase 2; FE stack undecided).
- One API only. Product: `AGENTS.md` + `.docs/cabin-pms-client-plan.md`.
- Phase 1 = `api` + `pms`. No `web` booking, CM, or OTA scraping in Phase 1.
- Unique-unit calendars. Overlap safety in Postgres.
- When editing `AGENTS.md`: rewrite cleanly — see root `AGENTS.md` → “How to write AGENTS.md”.
